\newlabel{fig:finalval}{{3}{5}{Final protocol, per-run statistics over 30 runs (log scale). (a) Median validation cost, training pulse pattern; (b) same, alternative pattern. Boxes: quartiles; thick lines: medians; dots: runs. (c) Median best training cost vs.\ evaluations, interquartile band. (d) Evaluations until training cost is within 1\% of its final value, per run. The five algorithms are indistinguishable in (a)-(b); PSO is the only one that visibly lags in (c)-(d)}{figure.caption.7}{}}
